    "name": "Renew + Smooth Serum",
    "description": "A retinol-based serum.\n\nFor skin that is hydrated, smooth and clear, make an appointment with By BEAUTY BAY's Renew + Smooth Serum with Retinol and Peptides. This skin-loving serum helps to improve the appearance of pigmentation, dark spots, fine lines, and wrinkles thanks to the 0.2% retinol complex while added peptides infuse the skin with moisture, helping to improve the skin’s clarity. Perfect for first-time retinol users, this serum is soon to be your new BFF. \n\n- Vegan\n- Cruelty-free\n- Fragrance-free\n- We recommend easing into using daily\n- Perfect for first-time retinol users\n- If you aren’t obsessed with your BY BEAUTY BAY product, we’ll give you __100% of your money back__ with our 100% Obsessed Promise. See full [T&Cs here](https://www.beautybay.com/s/obsessed-promise).\n",
    "ingredients": "Aqua (Water), Propanediol, Polysorbate 20, Tocopherol, Acetyl Hexapeptide-1, Retinol, Benzyl Alcohol, Xanthan Gum, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Ethylhexylglycerin, disodium Edta, Undecane, 1,2-hexanediol, Tridecane, Citric Acid.\n\n*Please be aware that ingredient lists for products in our brand are updated regularly. Please refer to the ingredient list on the product package for the most up-to-date list of ingredients to ensure it is suitable for your personal use.",
    "directions": "- Warnings – This product contains Vitamin A. It is not recommended to use in pregnancy and while breastfeeding. Use with caution if taking dietary supplements or using other products containing Vitamin A.\n\n- When first starting to use this serum, do not use daily, as your skin needs to build a tolerance to the retinol.\n- Use a couple of times a week at first and then build up to daily use.\n- Apply 1 to 2 drops directly onto the skin. \n- Use as part of your PM skincare routine. \n- Follow with SPF the morning after.\n",
